#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Baogu IME streaming ASR engine.

Realtime path:
  SIGUSR2 -> start recording immediately
  SIGUSR1 -> stop recording and commit the streaming final text

FireRedASR2 + optional LLM refinement run asynchronously after the streaming
result reaches Fcitx preedit. The engine stays responsive to the next utterance
while refinement is in flight. FinishSession atomically commits the corrected
sentence; stale results fail closed after focus/session changes.
"""
